{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/80c404f3b0ccdf4ed0cba9e425b74e25.avif?t=1757433848\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>You Alone Can Defeat Evil</i></strong>\u00a0 is a dark roguelike distilled into one impossible boss fight. Step into the role of a rogue sorcerer, an outcast of the Order of Eskilon, and face the Great Demon, a relentless foe designed to test your mastery, patience, and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with forbidden magic and bound by cursed tattoos, every run is a battle for survival. <strong>Death is inevitable, but each defeat brings new powers, hidden lore, and another chance to adapt.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/4db112a298e9664953dcefd885ae7136.poster.avif?t=1757433848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/4db112a298e9664953dcefd885ae7136.webm?t=1757433848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/4db112a298e9664953dcefd885ae7136.mp4?t=1757433848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/d6c376ef31407f0edb02365606cc0245.avif?t=1757433848\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Great Demon!</strong><br>Enter a relentless boss fight where every move counts and only mastery will decide your fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Forbidden Magic!</strong><br>Harness soul-twisting tattoos that grant new powers and let you forge your own combat style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move Like a Shadow!</strong><br>Dodge, weave, and strike in a fluid movement-based combat system built for precision and speed.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die to Grow Stronger!</strong><br>Each death etches a new tattoo into your flesh, reviving you stronger, wiser, and closer to victory.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Hidden Lore!</strong><br>Earn mystical lore books that reveal lost histories of Eskilon while gifting you new magical powers.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dark Secrets!</strong><br>Unveil hidden mechanics and mysterious elements that extend beyond the single-player experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Limits!</strong><br>With its punishing difficulty and skill-focused design, YACDE is crafted for players who crave a true challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you defeat the Great Demon? Or will you be just another forgotten soul in the ruins of Eskilon?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/0a936897ea088dafec311ad92ee0a3b8.poster.avif?t=1757433848\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/0a936897ea088dafec311ad92ee0a3b8.webm?t=1757433848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1274700/extras/0a936897ea088dafec311ad92ee0a3b8.mp4?t=1757433848\" type=\"video/mp4\"